        "TileImage": "$($repository 21a3f4cd-bc20-4fd2-82e2-c3bbcfc8762a).Image",
        "Description": "The gang of &quot;toy soldiers&quot; has been a source of tension for the people. These four people, at least. Crest wants these people gone, one of them being a pirate who was caught on camera trespassing in his base. As such, it is necessary to hide the bodies for a discreet removal (dumping into the sea) by his soldiers. Maybe you could do that job for them? Best of luck. This contract was a made a member of the Hitman Community known as linux_penguin.",
